abstract: "A printable acceptance worksheet for documenting customer, payment, dispensing, inventory, refund, fault, and settlement handoffs before a connected vending route goes live. The maintained customer-facing version is https://agevend.com/connected-vending-go-live-test.html; this open companion preserves the worksheet's operational, non-universal scope."
